rity\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Title base 'download-graph'. Nodes = members, urls, file_paths, next_language/next_stage targets; edges member->url (acquire_remote/http_client), url->file_path (write_file), member->next_language (handoff). Expose graph queries for likely question shapes: ordered_tokens chain (follow next_language/next_stage across files, '>'-joined), integer counts (distinct hosts, edges, stages), enum (member whose url/file_path is unique, root/leaf of the chain). Data already in every v=1/v=2/v=3 plan; no new decoding.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"plan-key-passthrough\", \"concept\": \"answer a question on ANY plan key without code change\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"v=3 plans carry keys never asked so far (`verdict=benign|suspicious` since D16; `language`). Generic resolver: answer-id field suffix (longest match, hyphens->underscores) -> plan key, with aliases campaign->campaign","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/home/testpwn/.claude/projects/-home-testpwn-huntress-2026/be6da17f-235a-4ec9-aa50-77364f254ac2/tool-results/b3ao211w0.txt","persistedOutputSize":36966},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QkHWA2Mec6DfJUh2Qrafeq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
